# Everything under the top-level data/ is generated at runtime (bar cache,
# catalog snapshot, saved universes) - see README "data/ Parquet cache".
# Leading slash is required: a bare `data/` would also swallow
# src/quant_trader/data/ and tests/data/.
/data/

*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.db

